.resources/TASK-260715-13labb/TASK-260715-13labb_results.md-3-## Outcome
.resources/TASK-260715-13labb/TASK-260715-13labb_results.md:4:Implemented the macOS-only SSH bootstrap error boundary with public CustomNSError domain sshProfileBootstrap, stable string and integer codes, fixed stages, finite user-action categories, terminal/retryableLater/cancelled disposition, typed privacy-safe internal causes, and bounded endpoint-family and reviewed-algorithm context. Runtime diagnostics now retain only the latest structured bootstrap projection for the active generation. No reconnect behavior was added.
.resources/TASK-260715-13labb/TASK-260715-13labb_results.md-5-
--
.resources/TASK-260715-13labb/TASK-260715-13labb_results.md-13-## Tests and validation
.resources/TASK-260715-13labb/TASK-260715-13labb_results.md:14:- SSHBootstrapErrorMappingTests: 10 tests, exit 0. Covers golden taxonomy, every stage, terminal gates, transient allowlist, typed internal cause, cancellation/user stop, authentication-stage timeout/transport precedence, hostile underlying text, prohibited data, POSIX/URL classes, and runtime snapshot round trip/clear.
.resources/TASK-260715-13labb/TASK-260715-13labb_results.md-15-- Focused macOS plus selected libssh2 evidence: 6 tests across 3 suites, exit 0. Covers OSStatus, NWError/POSIX, injected resolution/connect/KEX timeouts, and live authentication timeout.
.resources/TASK-260715-13labb/TASK-260715-13labb_results.md-16-- RuntimeDiagnosticsTests after schema allowlist update: 9 tests, exit 0.
.resources/TASK-260715-13labb/TASK-260715-13labb_results.md:17:- Initial make validate-core: exit 2 because the existing runtime snapshot reflection allowlist did not yet include sshBootstrapError. The allowlist was updated; no production behavior was weakened.
