.resources/TASK-260715-1tnjlu/TASK-260715-1tnjlu_review-rework-01.md:12:- AC3 PASS: ordinary post-settings queries have only virtual ingress to authenticated SSH or relay to the configured numeric exit endpoint. Physical DNS is limited to SSH-host bootstrap before routes or the accepted required-interface reconnect path, with actual SSH endpoint capture; exhaustion revokes safe DNS, stops admission, and clears settings.
