.resources/TASK-260715-24icoz/TASK-260715-24icoz_rework-02.md:1:Rework only the blocking temp-symlink finding in TASK-260715-24icoz_rework-01-review-results.md. Replace the predictable sibling .<archive>.tmp with an atomically created exclusive temporary regular file in the destination directory using safe standard-library primitives and ownership-aware cleanup. Never follow, overwrite, replace, or unlink an attacker-controlled pre-existing temp path. Preserve rejection of symlink/non-regular final destinations; after successful os.replace the final archive must be a regular non-symlink file. Add a regression reproducer that plants the old predictable temp symlink to a victim, invokes archive-assets, proves victim bytes/hash unchanged, planted symlink unchanged or safely ignored, final archive regular/non-symlink with exact four-member contract, and cleanup safe on injected failure. Rerun archive tests, both rootless macOS smokes, lint/privacy/diff, update outcome, and hand off to review. No VPN/signing/NetworkExtension operations.
