.resources/TASK-260715-2kchi0/TASK-260715-2kchi0_reviewer-focus.md:1:Perform an adversarial independent review of the M3 measurement/evidence protocol. Verify protocol authority and scope against the goal, .spec/validation.md, .spec/delivery.md, accepted ADR numeric-evidence gates, and current SPM harness/board graph. Check exact reproducibility: generators, seeds, warmup/steady/cooldown, impairment identity and restoration, isolation, clocks, sampling, raw manifest, hashes, statistics, effect/regression/multiplicity rules, immutable red/unavailable/invalid rows, privacy/capture authorization, fail-red safety gates, and cleanup. Confirm macOS-first rows are mandatory where autonomous or physical Mac evidence is later available, iPhone rows are explicitly deferred/schema-compatible, no benchmark or winner is claimed, and MTU/HEV/lane/window/rekey/QUIC/reconnect/memory values remain injectable evidence gates. Validate the JSON Schema, PlantUML source/render, every downstream task mapping and dependency, the new validator task atomicity, byte-identical resource copies, board/diff/privacy checks, and absence of secrets/local identifiers. Reject vague, tautological, post-hoc, or under-specified rules and any dependency cycles introduced by this task. Record exact evidence and use the reviewer verdict lifecycle.
