.resources/TASK-260715-2ywde4/TASK-260715-2ywde4_rework-01.md:1:Rework only the review-01 requested change from TASK-260715-2ywde4_review-verdict.md while preserving all already-green behavior. Replace the vacuous 64-zero comparison with an automated identity-versus-manifest mismatch/tamper rejection fixture. The comparator must consume canonical bounded identity output plus the manifest-selected target record and fail deterministically when selfSha256, size, target tuple, or selected executable bytes do not match. Bind scripts/tests/test-relay-shell-artifacts.sh identity smoke to relux-relay-manifest-v1.json or add an equivalent automated comparator at the exact bootstrap/release boundary; do not merely recompute expected SHA from the same queried executable. Use copied binary/manifest fixtures so canonical artifacts remain untouched. Preserve exact stdout/EOF/exit behavior, privacy-safe stderr, rootless lifecycle, pinned four-target builds, and honest native Intel/Linux CI-only boundaries. Rerun focused mismatch/tamper positives and negatives, pinned Go test/vet, protocol gate, reproducibility, verify, native arm64/Rosetta smoke, diff/privacy/board gates. Update task-scoped outcome and hand off to a fresh reviewer.
